<title>USA: Envirotest Q1 Dec 31 loss $0.37 vs profit.</title>
<headline>Envirotest Q1 Dec 31 loss $0.37 vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.37	 profit   $0.32</p>
<p> Net loss	  6,174	 profit   5,588</p>
<p> Revs		31,179		   28,184</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  16,620		   17,265</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Envirotest Systems Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 1995 results include one-time gain of $15.3 million from settlement with Commonwealth of Pennsylvania. Excluding that gain, results from that quarter showed a net loss of $6.1 million.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
